{"ID":"20230927144701-nny7oqm","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230927144701-nny7oqm","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927144701-nny7oqm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927144703-2vvffl3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240221103757-pr4ldwx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240221103757-pr4ldwx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"【大黄蛰虫丸】（大黄蟅虫丸）","type":"doc","updated":"20240221103757"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230927144703-2vvffl3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927144703-2vvffl3","updated":"20230927144711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"组成：大黄十两、黄芩二两、甘草三两、桃仁一升、杏仁一升、芍药四两、地黄十两、干漆一两、蝱虫一升、水蛭百枚、蛴螬一升、蟅虫半升。"}]},{"ID":"20230927144703-2jz7txw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927144703-2jz7txw","updated":"20230927144712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"右十二味，末之，炼蜜和丸，如小豆大，酒饮服五丸，日三服；"}]},{"ID":"20230927144703-c6sd8uj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927144703-c6sd8uj","updated":"20230927144713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：五劳虚极羸瘦，腹满不能饮食，食伤，忧伤，饮伤，房室伤，饥伤，劳伤，经络荣卫气伤，内有干血，肌肤甲错，两目黯黑，缓中补虚，大黄蜇虫丸主之。"}]},{"ID":"20230927144708-6z3lvgb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927144708-6z3lvgb"}},{"ID":"20230927144703-tuudehy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927144703-tuudehy","updated":"20230927144714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄蜇虫丸证：干血痨；就是人有血干在身体某处，形成一种虚劳，那也有人称烟尘病、神仙病（这个人几乎没有食欲，天天不怎么吃饭也能活）；"}]},{"ID":"20230927144703-9fq2jtw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927144703-9fq2jtw","updated":"20230927144715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄蛰虫丸针对的不是大血管的淤，因为大的淤抵当汤桃核承气汤就能替代，大黄蛰虫丸针对的是小的淤，越来越累积的血气不足，好像河床堆积沙子一样淤在微血管的淤，这种淤用桃核承气汤抵当汤是打不掉的。"}]},{"ID":"20230927144703-05zpuor","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927144703-05zpuor","updated":"20230927144715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"临床上大黄蛰虫丸最好认就是这样的症状，就是你这个人莫名其妙身体有一块地方特别容易干特别容易掉屑屑，那这样子就代表身体某个地方淤住了。"}]},{"ID":"20240221103757-pr4ldwx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221103757-pr4ldwx"}}]}